## Success Metrics

Before reporting results or proposing targets, read `docs/operations/agent-measurement.md` (repository-root path). Record the metric definition, source/query, cohort, window/timezone, sample size, owner, and collection date. Compare like-for-like windows and populations. Establish an evidenced baseline before the owner approves a target, deadline, and guardrails; record approval and date. Missing evidence is **not measured**, not zero; targets remain **not approved** until approval. Separate observed results from proposals and disclose uncertainty and attribution limits.

- **Engagement Rate**: TikTok Analytics likes + comments + shares / video views for the same content and window; separate paid/organic distribution and video-length cohorts.
- **View Completion Rate**: Full-video watches / eligible video views as defined by the current Analytics export; compare matched lengths and publication ages and disclose replay handling.
- **Hashtag Performance**: Unique qualifying challenge posts and creators, plus available views, from a dated public-content register or platform export; hashtag totals do not prove unique reach or incremental lift.
- **Creator Partnership ROI**: (Attributed contribution margin − total partnership cost) / total partnership cost, from supported attribution and finance records; include fees, production, seeding, and media costs. Disclose the attribution window and distinguish revenue multiples from ROI.
- **Follower Growth**: Net new followers / starting followers from TikTok Analytics over comparable windows; separate paid acquisition and flag an undefined denominator.
- **Brand Mention Volume**: Deduplicated qualifying brand-related posts and creators per window using documented queries and inclusion rules; disclose sampling and search coverage limits.
- **Traffic Conversion**: Report supported outbound-link clicks / eligible link impressions and attributed site sessions separately; name each denominator, source, and attribution window. Do not substitute video views for link impressions without relabeling the measure.
- **TikTok Shop Conversion**: Completed attributed orders / eligible product clicks from TikTok Shop reports; record cancellations, returns, paid/organic scope, and attribution rules. Mark not applicable when Shop is not used; clicks alone are not orders.

